  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "summon or control toy chariot to blind enemies",
    "skill1": "summon heals weakest nearby ally or restores energy",
    "skill2": "control toy plane to stun the farthest enemy",
    "skill3": "battle ATK increase",
    "skill4": "summon aura inspires adjacent allies with haste",
    "skill5": "blind extends while summon health is above half"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Damian]] summons toys that heal the weakest allies, restore Energy, stun distant foes, and blind enemies from a controllable chariot. His summon aura grants Haste to adjacent allies, and battle ATK rises over time. Blinds last longer while summon health stays high. He mixes healing, buffing, and soft control through multiple summons. Focusing and destroying the toys early removes his healing, control, and blind extension.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Damian]] never enters the field and is unhittable while toy chariots heal, haste adjacent allies, blind, and stun your farthest unit. Do not try to pin or delete him; collapse the chariot and toys so the support package stops. Answer them with area coverage from [[Shemira]], [[Frieren]], or [[Pandora]], while protecting the backline from the plane stun. Use the rebuild window to finish before a second chariot comes online."
}
